<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', backgroundColor: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '8px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8' }} />
    <Box style={{ padding: '30px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>过去遇到的问题：等、乱、漂、爆</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#8B97A8' }}>05 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>如果拿手机去拍一个房间，这四件事几乎一定会遇到——它们不是算法"不够准"，而是<b>流程本身没有为现场反馈设计</b>。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '16px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: '32px', height: '32px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>1</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>等：必须等图到齐</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>离线流程要求全部图像就位才能开算。现场拍完不知道行不行，回家发现漏拍，只能整组重拍。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>返工成本最高</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: '32px', height: '32px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>2</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>乱：顺序不能用了</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>随手拍的顺序与空间邻接无关，没法只比相邻帧，只能两两匹配：1000 张约 50 万对，耗时陡增。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>SfM 从分钟变小时</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0px 40px', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: '32px', height: '32px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>3</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>漂：回访时接不上</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>边走边建误差累积，绕一圈回来发现首尾差半米。传统做法重跑一次全局 BA，几分钟起步。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>实时性当场归零</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: '32px', height: '32px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 4, alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>4</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>爆：大场景显存</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 10 }}>高斯数随场景线性增长。论文实测：不开层级结构，CityWalk 到第 <b>795 / 4050</b> 帧就 OOM。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#D9534F', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 10 }}>规模一上来就跑不完</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ margin: '18px 40px 0px 40px', backgroundColor: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 22px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>四个现象收敛成三条必须同时成立的约束：即时（每帧数百毫秒）· 无序（不依赖帧序）· 全局一致（回环能修）。过去的方法最多同时满足两条。</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
